    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "daughter of Zeus and Mnemosyne; mother by Achelous of Ligeia, Thelxiepea, Molpe, Aglaope, Pisinoe and Leucosia. Melpomene (Apollodorus) or Terpsichore (Apollonius); not decided. Identity of Heinfried Birlenbach, written over it by an import, removed 2026-10-10"
